# Research trees: kept on the author's disk, not published with the plugin. Raw model
# transcripts trip the catalog's install-time security scan, and none of it is loaded at
# runtime. See docs/spec.md §16 for what the evidence showed.
#
# One exception: the idea-states benchmark publishes its report, plots, scripts and the
# per-model aggregates, because a claim about what a state does to a list should be
# checkable. The raw transcripts and run logs stay here — they are what the scanner
# objects to, and the aggregates carry every number the report states.
experiments/*
!experiments/idea-states/
experiments/idea-states/results-*.json
experiments/idea-states/variation-*.json
experiments/idea-states/log-*.log
